    "Dictionary": {
        "Entries": {
            "zh-cn": {
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Result_Timestop_1": "时间仍未恢复流动，$self$保持着先前那一瞬间的表情。",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Result_Timestop_2": "$self$静止在原地，完全不知道同行已经解除。",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Result_Timestop_3": "周围的空气仿佛凝固着，$self$一动也不动。",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Result_Sleep_1": "$self$缩了缩身子，在睡梦里发出一声轻哼。",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Result_Sleep_2": "就算同行的关系解除了，睡着的$self$也毫无察觉。",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Result_Sleep_3": "$self$睡得很沉，呼吸绵长而均匀。",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Result_Fainted_1": "$self$依旧昏迷不醒，没有任何回应。",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Result_Fainted_2": "昏厥中的$self$安静地躺着，对分开的事一无所知。",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Result_Fainted_3": "$self$的眼皮没有半点颤动，仍然处于昏迷状态。",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Result_Woken_1": "“唔……分开走吗？知道了，你先去吧。”",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Result_Woken_2": "$self$揉了揉眼睛，迷迷糊糊地点头：“那我也回去接着睡了。”",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Result_Woken_3": "“刚睡醒脑子还有点晕……行，回头再说。”",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Result_Receiver_1": "“那待会儿见，$target$。”",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Result_Receiver_2": "$self$松了口气，活动了一下站得有些僵的肩膀。",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Result_Receiver_3": "“总算能各干各的了，回头见。”",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Begin_Timestop_1": "时间静止中的$self$保持着原本的站姿，连眨眼都没有。",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Begin_Timestop_2": "被定在原地的$self$毫无动静，像是没听见任何声响。",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Begin_Timestop_3": "$self$的动作停在半途，静止得像一尊塑像。",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Begin_Sleep_1": "$self$在睡梦里含糊地唔了一声，没有醒过来。",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Begin_Sleep_2": "睡着中的$self$翻了个身，呼吸依旧平稳。",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Begin_Sleep_3": "$self$皱了皱眉又很快松开，还沉在睡意里。",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Begin_Fainted_1": "$self$昏沉沉地闭着眼，对周围的动静毫无反应。",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Begin_Fainted_2": "失去意识的$self$一动不动，只剩下微弱的呼吸。",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Begin_Fainted_3": "$self$的意识还没恢复，对$target$的话全无知觉。",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Begin_Receiver_1": "“好，那我就先去忙自己的了。”",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Begin_Receiver_2": "$self$点点头，把原本跟着走的步子收了回来。",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Begin_Receiver_3": "“行，有事再叫我。”",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Refuse_Woken_1": "“吵醒我就是为了说这个？我不想分开。”",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Refuse_Woken_2": "$self$皱着眉坐起身，有些不快地看着$target$：“先别走。”",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Refuse_Woken_3": "“我还没清醒呢，别丢下我一个人啊。”",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Refuse_1": "“等等，我现在还不想分开走。”",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Refuse_2": "$self$站着没动，看向$target$：“再一起待会儿不行吗？”",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Refuse_3": "“这边我一个人不太熟，还是先跟着你吧。”",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Interrupt_Doer_1": "“$target$，我们刚打算解散，你有事吗？”",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Interrupt_Doer_2": "$self$顺势朝$target$抬了抬手：“正好碰上，省得再跑一趟。”",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Interrupt_Doer_3": "“刚把这边的事告一段落，$target$怎么过来了？”",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Interrupt_Receiver_1": "“啊，$target$，我们正好说到要各走各的呢。”",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Interrupt_Receiver_2": "$self$停下道别的话头，转过身看向$target$：“你找我们有事？”",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Interrupt_Receiver_3": "“刚准备分开走，$target$你来得正好。”",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Tryjoin_1": "“我看你们好像要分开了，$target$，我能过来搭句话吗？”",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Tryjoin_2": "$self$走近几步，试探着问$target$：“这边已经谈完了？”",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Tryjoin_3": "“$target$，你们解散了的话，待会儿方便一起吗？”",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Joined_1": "“太好了，正好有事想跟$target$你聊。”",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Joined_2": "$self$走上前来，站到了$target$身边：“还以为赶不上呢。”",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Joined_3": "“那接下来算我一个吧。”",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Join_Refused_1": "“行，那我就不打扰你们收尾了。”",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Join_Refused_2": "$self$停在原地，朝$target$点点头：“忙完再说吧。”",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Join_Refused_3": "“没事，我先到旁边待着。”",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Join_Doer_1": "“来得巧，$target$，这边刚好谈完。”",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Join_Doer_2": "$self$看向$target$：“有什么事直接说就行。”",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Join_Doer_3": "“正好省得我再去找你了，$target$。”",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Join_Receiver_1": "“你来啦，$target$，这边正好要散了。”",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Join_Receiver_2": "$self$朝$target$挪出一点空位，顺便打了声招呼。",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Join_Receiver_3": "“刚说要分开呢，$target$有别的安排？”",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_JoinFailed_Doer_1": "“先等我们把这边的事收个尾吧，$target$。”",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_JoinFailed_Doer_2": "$self$示意$target$先等等：“过会儿再说。”",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_JoinFailed_Doer_3": "“现在人多嘴杂的，晚点再找你。”",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_JoinFailed_Receiver_1": "“这边先处理完手头的事，$target$你先去忙吧。”",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_JoinFailed_Receiver_2": "$self$朝$target$摆了摆手：“回头再找你说话。”",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_JoinFailed_Receiver_3": "“不好意思啊$target$，现在不太方便插话。”",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Refuse_Fallback_1": "$self$开口挽留道：“先别急着散啊，再待一会儿吧。”",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Begin_Fallback_1": "$self$收拢起情绪，准备各自解散。",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Fallback_1": "$self$点点头，各自散开去忙自己的事了。",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Join_Refused_Fallback_1": "$self$摆了摆手：“行，那我不凑过来了。”",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Joined_Fallback_1": "$self$点了点头，跟着一并散开。",
                "com_interaction_partyDisband_Tryjoin_Fallback_1": "$self$走过来搭话：“你们这是要散了吗？”"
            }
        }
    }
}
